&lt;p style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Manages and structures the execution of partner and channel marketing initiatives across LATAM along with the&amp;nbsp;LATAM Marketing Leadership: co-marketing campaigns, regional governance, operational visibility, and&amp;nbsp;enablement support.&lt;/p&gt;
