&lt;li&gt;Negotiating contracts with customers, suppliers and technology partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drafting documents using a commercial, client focused style&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and organization skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cooperating effectively as part of a team, sharing information and responsibility&lt;/li&gt;
