&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Join the Future of Security at Netskope&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Netskope (NASDAQ: NTSK) is a leader in modern security and networking for the cloud and AI era. We secure and accelerate cloud, data, and AI in real time, everywhere. Thousands of customers, including more than 30 of the Fortune 100, trust the Netskope One platform, its Zero Trust Engine, and the powerful NewEdge network to gain full visibility and control without performance trade-offs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Netskope, our technology is driven by our greatest strength: our people. We believe that belonging powers innovation, and success is both personal and organizational. We embrace differences in gender, ethnicity, beliefs, ability, and identity, creating an environment where every voice is heard and respected. We empower our employees to bring their authentic selves to work, grow their careers through continuous education and mentorship, and lead with transparency and curiosity. Join a team where you belong, where you are encouraged to be an entrepreneur, and where together, we continue to redefine the landscape of security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.netskope.com/company/careers&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Careers at Netskope&lt;/a&gt; to learn more. Follow us on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/netskope&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/netskope/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine leading the team that keeps the heart of a global security platform beating. At Netskope, our Foundation Engineering team manages the near real-time configuration propagation across more than 100 global data centers. We are looking for a Director of Engineering who doesn&#39;t just manage but inspires—someone who can combine deep technical judgment with an AI-first leadership philosophy to help us scale our foundational cloud services to new heights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be at the helm of a high-impact team building the essential systems that every other service at Netskope depends on. You will have the agency to shape the technical direction of our global cloud infrastructure, drive engineering excellence through AI integration, and mentor the next generation of engineering leaders within our organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading People and Driving Execution -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and Grow: You will manage and mentor engineering managers and tech leads, driving organizational growth through strategic hiring and hands-on coaching.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the Delivery: You’ll be responsible for the end-to-end delivery of scalable, resilient foundational services across our 100+ global data centers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate Across the Board: You’ll work closely with Product, Program Management, and other engineering service owners to align priorities and clear any technical roadblocks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Vision and Innovation -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the Future: Lead the architecture for distributed systems, runtime synchronization, and high-volume, high-availability cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace AI-First: Foster a culture where AI isn&#39;t just a buzzword; you&#39;ll integrate AI tools into daily workflows to accelerate velocity and eliminate operational toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring to the table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Experience: You have 15+ years in software engineering, with at least 5 years specifically managing managers and multi-team organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Expertise: You are an expert in distributed systems, infra-services, data synchronization, cloud infrastructure, and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership Track Record: You have a proven ability to navigate cross-team negotiations, resolve bottlenecks, and maintain the highest engineering standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI Savvy: You have hands-on experience leveraging AI to boost team performance and delivery leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Distributed Team Leadership: Experience leading remote teams across multiple countries and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A background in cybersecurity or network security technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Kubernetes and containerized deployments at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with observability, monitoring, and on-call operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of reducing operational toil through automation and AI-driven tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
