&lt;li&gt;Analytical, operational, and problem-solving skills with extreme attention to detail.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Excel/Google Sheets, navigating large data sets, and building models&lt;/li&gt;
