&lt;li&gt;Experience working on U.S. hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication: Exceptional English proficiency (both written and verbal) is required. Must&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;be well-spoken, confident, and capable of presenting complex financial data simply to non-finance stakeholders and senior US executives.&lt;/li&gt;
