&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Netskope is dedicated to building a thriving employee and team environment where everyone&amp;nbsp;can do their best work!&lt;br&gt;As a dynamic HR Ops Program Manager within our Global People Experience team, you will&amp;nbsp;champion operational excellence by weaving Agile methodologies and AI innovations into the&amp;nbsp;fabric of our employee lifecycle. You’ll translate complex SOX and regulatory requirements into&amp;nbsp;efficient, scalable employee experiences. Reporting to the Sr. Director of HR Ops, you will drive&amp;nbsp;cross-functional global initiatives, transform complex compliance and workflow needs into fluid,&amp;nbsp;tech-forward experiences that define the future of HR operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead the end-to-end design, implementation and launch of an enterprise HR virtual&amp;nbsp;assistant (service desk) powered by Atlassian Rovo with Jira Service Management. You will own&amp;nbsp;the project lifecycle ground-up architecture to user adoption, knowledge base integration, and&amp;nbsp;ongoing AI optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
