&lt;li&gt;Applies Agile project management methodologies and best practices to all HR initiatives, including AI-driven technical transformations&lt;br&gt;Using the TA and HR Ops dashboards, perform monthly and quarterly analytical reviews of data to convert core metrics into practical and actionable, leadership-focused insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assists with mentoring team members with content development and maintenance to our employee-facing and internal knowledge bases. Regularly engages COEs to ensure content is current and relevant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HRIS via user-acceptance testing (UAT) with system upgrades, feature releases, interfaces, integrations and data conversion projects across all functional areas of HR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Responsible for documenting process changes to work instructions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides administrative coverage for the team, as needed, across the full employee and contractor lifecycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Builds and maintains relationships across all People and Talent and key operational stakeholders (Payroll/FP&amp;amp;A, Legal, Security and IT) to maintain business continuity&lt;br&gt;Content management and maintenance of the HR Intranet sites&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Answers general employee/manager HR questions and requests, and supports internal HR escalations within team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Knowledge and Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen, including problem-solving and critical thinking skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Views all projects through a global lens, with harmonization and transformation at the root of all projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep comfort navigating complexity and ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and disciplined with a strong work ethic; ability to take initiative with workload and know how to effectively prioritize work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to maintain utmost confidentiality regarding employee and applicant information&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Can seamlessly work in a team environment being flexible, positive, approachable, and have strong interpersonal communication and partnership skills&lt;/li&gt;
