&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Product Marketing Manager, SASE &lt;/strong&gt;drives the overall product marketing strategy and execution for Netskope’s core Secure Access Service Edge solution, partnering with the SD-WAN PMM to deliver a compelling solution message. This role will work closely with stakeholders across product management, business development, field, channel, and marketing to identify, implement, and execute the go-to-market strategy for Netskope’s leading Netskope One SASE product suite and core SWG, CASB and ZTNA components. This includes identifying the market opportunity, developing differentiated marketing messaging and positioning content, and programs, and enabling our sales and channel partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic role that will have responsibility for working with leadership to develop clear plans and goals and work across the organization to drive business results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;
