&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the position:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Experience Management (DEM) Solutions Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, you are the technical bridge between our digital experience management platform and our prospective customers. You won&#39;t just &quot;demo&quot; software; you will diagnose complex performance issues and design solutions that help enterprises ensure their employees and customers have a seamless digital experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will partner with Account Executive teams to participate in sales cycles, proving the value of our telemetry and analytics through technical discovery and customized proof-of-value (POV) engagements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities include:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead technical deep-dives to understand a prospect’s current digital ecosystem, including network bottlenecks, device performance, and application latency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Architect DEM strategies that remove performance visibility gaps and provide actionable data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Evangelism:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver high-impact demonstrations that translate that showcase the DEM value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proof of Value (POV):&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the end-to-end technical evaluation process, helping customers deploy and configure the DEM solution based on success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Feedback Loop:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a liaison between the field and Product Management to influence the roadmap based on market requirements and competitive intelligence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years in a Sales Engineering, Solutions Architect, or Technical Consultant role, preferably within DEM, APM (Application Performance Monitoring), or Network Performance Monitoring (NPM) sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MTTR Reduction Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven history of solving multi-vendor &quot;blame games&quot; by objectively proving whether a fault lies with the local device, home Wi-Fi, ISP, transit provider, security proxy, or target SaaS application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid &amp;amp; Cloud Architecture:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical background working with zero-trust network access (ZTNA), split-tunnel client steering, and enterprise cloud connections (AWS DirectConnect, Azure ExpressRoute).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Troubleshooter:&lt;/strong&gt; You get a rush from finding the &quot;needle in the haystack&quot; of a complex system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Storyteller:&lt;/strong&gt; You can explain the impact of a 500ms latency improvement on employee productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Adaptable Peer:&lt;/strong&gt; You thrive in a fast-paced environment where the tech stack evolves every quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skillset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protocol &amp;amp; Packet Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep mastery of Wireshark and tcpdump to inspect TCP windowing, TLS handshakes, HTTP/1.1–HTTP/3, and payload overhead.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hop-by-Hop Path Routing:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency with MTR, BGP, DNS pathing, and ICMP/UDP probing to pinpoint latency, jitter, and packet loss across public ISPs, SD-WAN, and cloud edge proxies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Synthetic &amp;amp; Performance Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience scripting synthetic transaction probes, API tests, and stress tests (e.g., ThousandEyes, Catchpoint, JMeter) to baseline throughput and SLA compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Observability &amp;amp; Telemetry Pipelines:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on work with OpenTelemetry, NetFlow/sFlow, SNMP, and custom dashboarding/alerting in platforms like Grafana, Splunk, or Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Endpoint &amp;amp; Local Network Diagnostics:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to isolate client-side issues like local Wi-Fi signal degradation, OS socket exhaustion, driver bugs, and security agent hooks on Windows/macOS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scripting &amp;amp; API Automation:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in Python, Bash, or PowerShell to query REST APIs, automate diagnostic log gathering, and custom-script performance checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to query and visualize data. Experience with SQL, Python, or BI tools (Tableau/PowerBI) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional ability to &quot;translate&quot; technical metrics into ROI for C-level executives (CIO, CPO, Head of Digital Workplace).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Endpoint OS&lt;/strong&gt; (Windows, macOS, Linux).&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Knowledge of &lt;strong&gt;Networking &amp;amp; Cloud&lt;/strong&gt; (DNS, VPN, ZTNA, AWS/Azure connectivity).&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;- Familiarity with &lt;strong&gt;Web Technologies&lt;/strong&gt; (JavaScript, API integrations, Browser Developer Tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join This Team?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Experience is no longer a &quot;nice-to-have&quot;—it is the backbone of the modern hybrid workforce. In this role, you’ll be at the forefront of the &lt;strong&gt;Digital Experience&lt;/strong&gt; revolution, solving the &quot;it&#39;s slow&quot; complaint once and for all using data-driven evidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, Engineering, or related field preferred; equivalent experience may be considered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
