&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and customer-focused Intermediate SD-WAN Sales Engineer to join our overlay specialist sales team. In this role, you will act as a technical advisor and product expert, working directly with clients and prospects to demonstrate the capabilities of our SD-WAN solutions and to ensure successful implementation of our products. This role requires a blend of technical knowledge and sales acumen to help clients understand the value of SD-WAN in addressing their network needs. If you have a passion for both technology and customer engagement, this position offers an excellent opportunity to contribute to our business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly impactful role – You will have a compelling opportunity to impact the business and advance your career.&lt;/p&gt;
