&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Pre-Sales Support:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; Collaborate with sales representatives to understand client requirements, present technical solutions, and tailor demonstrations that align with customer needs and showcase SD-WAN capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Technical Expertise &amp;amp; Product Demos:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; Conduct in-depth product demonstrations and technical presentations to prospective clients, explaining the features, functionality, and advantages of SD-WAN solutions to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Solution Design:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; Work closely with clients to assess their current network environments and design customized SD-WAN solutions that meet their business objectives, ensuring the solution aligns with performance, scalability, and security needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Proposal Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt; Assist in developing proposals and RFP responses by providing detailed technical input, solution designs, and cost estimates for SD-WAN deployment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
