&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills with C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in data structures and algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep Understanding of TCP/IP Networking Protocols&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of &lt;strong&gt;macOS internals&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing software on &lt;strong&gt;macOS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of cryptography techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with writing multi-platform code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web data formats like JSON, XML, MIME, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
