&lt;li&gt;AI-Assisted Engineering: Proven practical adoption of AI tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Gemini) for code generation, debugging, root cause analysis, and increasing delivery velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points if you have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Venafi, HashiCorp Vault, or other enterprise PKI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Worked with HSMs and managed cryptographic keys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in AWS, Azure, or GCP cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skills with Docker, Kubernetes, and Helm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with GitHub Actions, Jenkins, or Drone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Used Terraform or Ansible to manage infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability tools like Prometheus, Grafana, or Datadog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Linux mastery and shell scripting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of service meshes like Istio or Linkerd.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
