&lt;p&gt;Great agentic AI depends on the data behind it. As a Senior Staff Backend Engineer, you build the &lt;strong&gt;configuration service&lt;/strong&gt; that drives every client and the &lt;strong&gt;telemetry pipeline&lt;/strong&gt; that turns raw production signals into the performance, security, and quality insights that tell the team what to build next. Ingest, classify, aggregate, dashboard: you own that spine, and it runs against usage from Netskope’s large customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What’s in it for you&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You build the measurement engine.&lt;/strong&gt; The team’s whole strategy, optimize where the data points, runs on the pipeline you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Green-field backend.&lt;/strong&gt; This function is net-new. You’ll set the patterns, not inherit them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real scale to build against.&lt;/strong&gt; Netskope’s customer footprint gives your pipelines production signals at a volume most teams never touch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the &lt;strong&gt;configuration backend service&lt;/strong&gt; that manages and delivers config to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the &lt;strong&gt;telemetry pipeline&lt;/strong&gt;: ingest usage events, run a multi-category classifier, aggregate performance/security/quality patterns, and feed per-user and exec dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship reliable, observable, secure &lt;strong&gt;services and APIs&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Golang and/or Python&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the ML team (which consumes the data) and the endpoint team (which emits it), and with partner orgs on the dashboard front-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required skills and experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10+ years of overall industry experience&lt;/strong&gt;, with &lt;strong&gt;6+ years in backend/services and distributed systems&lt;/strong&gt; in &lt;strong&gt;Golang and/or Python&lt;/strong&gt;: services, APIs, and data pipelines/ETL you’ve built and operated in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with &lt;strong&gt;telemetry, event, or data pipelines&lt;/strong&gt; and the storage/query systems behind them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes and cloud platforms (AWS)&lt;/strong&gt; for deploying, scaling, and operating production services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of REST/HTTPS/TLS and designing and shipping secure APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluency with agentic coding systems and genuine curiosity about agent harnesses like Claude Code, Pi, and Codex&lt;/strong&gt;, bonus if you’ve instrumented one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise with data structures and algorithms; strong communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
