&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Highly motivated self-starters, eager to learn, determined to adapt quickly, and comfortable with some ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Expert with Salesforce.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor Degree preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
